<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:s="https://wvusports.com/services/xml_schema/story" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title /><link>https://wvusports.com/rss/</link><description /><atom:link href="https://wvusports.com/rss" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><language>en-us</language><ttl>60</ttl><item><title>Pozos Earns Sun Belt Offensive Player of the Week</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/15/mens-soccer-pozos-earns-sun-belt-offensive-player-of-the-week</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/15/mens-soccer-pozos-earns-sun-belt-offensive-player-of-the-week</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Pablo Pozos celebrates after scoring a goal against Denver" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/15/DSC08926_1_large.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Senior Pablo Pozos of the West Virginia University men's soccer team has been named the Sun Belt Offensive Player of the Week.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/15/DSC08926_1_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/15/DSC08926_1_large.jpg"><media:title>Pablo Pozos celebrates after scoring a goal against Denver</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/15/DSC08926_1_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59396</s:story_id></item><item><title>WVU Athletics Invites Educators to Take Advantage of Special Oklahoma State Ticket Offer</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/15/football-wvu-athletics-invites-educators-to-take-advantage-of-special-oklahoma-state-ticket-offer</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/15/football-wvu-athletics-invites-educators-to-take-advantage-of-special-oklahoma-state-ticket-offer</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="A group of WVU cheerleaders, students and football student-athlete Nate Flower celebrate Extra-Yard-For-Teachers-2026 program" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/15/ExtraYardForTeachers-36.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – WVU Athletics is reminding educators across the state of West Virginia to take advantage of special ticket pricing for the Mountaineers' Big 12 Conference home opener against Oklahoma State on Saturday, Sept. 26, at 7 p.m. at Milan Puskar Stadium.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/15/ExtraYardForTeachers-36.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/15/ExtraYardForTeachers-36.jpg"><media:title>A group of WVU cheerleaders, students and football student-athlete Nate Flower celebrate Extra-Yard-For-Teachers-2026 program</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/15/ExtraYardForTeachers-36.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 09:59:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>2</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59395</s:story_id></item><item><title>Oklahoma State Game to be Televised at 7 p.m., ET on FS1</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/14/football-oklahoma-state-game-to-be-televised-at-7-pm-et-on-fs1</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/14/football-oklahoma-state-game-to-be-televised-at-7-pm-et-on-fs1</guid><category>Football</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="OKStateGame